WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.770 line:90%
Joining us now US Surgeon

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.260 line:90%
General Dr. Jerome Adams Dr.

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:07.050 line:90%
Adams Thanks for being here.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.119 line:90%
Thank you for having me Bret

00:00:08.119 --> 00:00:09.380 line:90%
and thank you to the American

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:10.760 line:90%
people who kept it small

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.050 line:90%
and smart this Thanksgiving

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:13.940 line:90%
millions of people did the right

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:14.820 line:90%
thing.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.580 line:90%
And for those who did travel

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.110 line:90%
and those who did attend large

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:19.640 line:90%
gatherings we want you to know

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.660 line:90%
it's not too late to take

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.130 line:90%
measures to slow the spread

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.900 line:90%
of this virus you can still

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.970 line:90%
isolate you can still get tested

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:27.797 line:90%
in 3 to five days you can still

00:00:27.797 --> 00:00:28.730 line:90%
take measures that have been

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:31.200 line:90%
proven to help us prevent cases,

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.700 line:90%
hospitalizations, and deaths

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.390 line:90%
while speaking of that new cases

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:38.530 line:90%
of Friday surpassed 205,000

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:39.850 line:90%
and that was breaking a record

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:40.810 line:90%
set the week before

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:42.790 line:90%
hospitalizations were at record

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:44.180 line:90%
levels in a number of states,

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:45.610 line:90%
including Oregon Washington

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.500 line:90%
Indiana and Pennsylvania so I

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:48.940 line:90%
guess the question is is this

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:51.160 line:90%
what a dark winter looks like

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:52.750 line:90%
or do you forecast that this is

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:53.980 line:90%
going to get worse in coming

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:56.060 line:90%
weeks.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:57.520 line:90%
Well I want to be straight with

00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:59.140 line:90%
the American people it's going

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.640 line:90%
to get worse over the next

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:01.760 line:90%
several weeks.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.580 line:90%
But the actions that we take

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.260 line:90%
in the next several days will

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:07.000 line:90%
determine how bad it is

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.470 line:90%
or whether or not we continue

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:10.180 line:90%
to flatten our curve in right

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.950 line:90%
before Thanksgiving we actually

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.600 line:90%
saw cases start to plateau

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.070 line:90%
and many states that have been

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:16.893 line:90%
aggressively mitigating and as I

00:01:16.893 --> 00:01:17.860 line:90%
mentioned there are steps you

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:19.160 line:90%
can take right now.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:20.470 line:90%
But I also want people to know

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.930 line:90%
there's hope we are mere weeks

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.000 line:90%
away from starting to vaccinate

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.530 line:90%
the vulnerable and we can

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:28.690 line:90%
significantly protect people who

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:30.380 line:90%
are at risk for this virus.

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:31.930 line:90%
So hang on just a little bit

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:33.310 line:90%
longer I understand that

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:34.720 line:90%
the science out there has never

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:35.920 line:90%
been stronger to support

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:37.510 line:90%
the wearing of masks you

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:39.040 line:90%
shouldn't have to have a mandate

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.330 line:90%
to do the right thing to protect

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:41.830 line:90%
your neighbor to keep schools

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.720 line:90%
open make sure you're watching

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:44.990 line:90%
your distance and make sure,

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:45.790 line:90%
again, if you've been

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:46.990 line:90%
in a gathering of more than 10

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:48.970 line:90%
people without your mask on over

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:51.280 line:90%
the last several days please get

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:52.600 line:90%
tested in the next three to five

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:55.710 line:90%
days I want to talk about

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:57.150 line:90%
the vaccines the therapeutics

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.060 line:90%
in just a second.

00:01:58.060 --> 00:01:59.610 line:90%
But what do you think looking

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:02.130 line:90%
back now was the biggest mistake

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:03.450 line:90%
the administration health

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:05.610 line:90%
experts made since this pandemic

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:09.190 line:90%
started well that is a great

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:09.990 line:90%
question.

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:12.220 line:90%
And there are many different

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:13.810 line:90%
things that we could have done

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:15.790 line:90%
differently this virus has been

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:18.760 line:90%
challenging I wish that that

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:19.630 line:90%
again this hadn't been

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:20.890 line:90%
superimposed on top

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:23.560 line:90%
of an election I wish that

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:25.240 line:90%
we'd been able to come together

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.830 line:90%
as a nation and really talk

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:28.030 line:90%
about the science instead

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:28.900 line:90%
of the politics

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:30.430 line:90%
and that's on all sides

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:32.260 line:90%
that's all around but what I

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:33.430 line:90%
want people to know is moving

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:36.030 line:90%
forward again, the science

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:38.380 line:90%
it's never been stronger

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:39.970 line:90%
in terms of what we can do

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:41.890 line:90%
simple powerful measures

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:42.700 line:90%
I'm wearing a mask

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.240 line:90%
as an instrument of freedom.

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:45.580 line:90%
It actually will let my kids go

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.570 line:90%
to school it will protect

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:47.740 line:90%
my mother and you and I talked

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:49.690 line:90%
about this before the interview

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:50.800 line:90%
my mother's in the hospital

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.300 line:90%
right now I want people

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:54.310 line:90%
to understand that if cases

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:56.380 line:90%
and hospitalizations continue

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.570 line:90%
to go up not only will it hurt

00:02:58.570 --> 00:02:59.770 line:90%
our ability to care for COVID

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:00.650 line:90%
patients.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:02.410 line:90%
But if someone's having a baby

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.370 line:90%
they may not be able to get

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.350 line:90%
a bed if someone is having

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:06.880 line:90%
a heart attack or a potential

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.650 line:90%
stroke like my mother they may

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:10.180 line:90%
not be able to get a bed

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.370 line:90%
your actions have consequences

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.030 line:90%
and if you do the right thing,

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:14.830 line:90%
then it will bridges

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:16.930 line:90%
to a vaccine so hopeful

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.460 line:90%
so hopeful that we can get

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:19.960 line:90%
to that vaccine with a few lives

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:22.940 line:90%
lost as possible Yeah you

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:24.170 line:90%
tweeted out last week that

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.510 line:90%
the CDC and others now estimate

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.610 line:90%
that 50% or even more

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:30.980 line:90%
of the infections that are

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:31.790 line:90%
around the country are

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.170 line:90%
transmitted from people who are

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.570 line:90%
not exhibiting symptoms

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.760 line:90%
obviously that was not what was

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.380 line:90%
believed that the beginning

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:42.270 line:90%
of this pandemic.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:43.730 line:90%
Absolutely and I'm so glad you

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:45.350 line:90%
brought that up because again

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:46.910 line:90%
mask had become politicized

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.110 line:90%
but I want people to understand

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:49.760 line:90%
that in the beginning we did not

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:51.140 line:90%
think based on our experience

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.700 line:90%
with any other respiratory virus

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:53.690 line:90%
that we would have this high

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:56.190 line:90%
degree of asymptomatic spread

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:57.350 line:90%
that means people spreading it

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.330 line:90%
who look fine who feel fine who

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:00.750 line:90%
don't have a fever,

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:02.600 line:90%
we now know that over 50%

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.130 line:90%
of people according to the CDC

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.450 line:90%
who are spreading this virus

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:07.160 line:90%
in the community look and feel

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:08.900 line:90%
fine that's why we want you

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:09.770 line:90%
to know that household

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.540 line:90%
gatherings they've been super

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:12.830 line:90%
spreader events they've been

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.110 line:90%
opportunities that have led led

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:17.240 line:90%
to viral spread and it's why we

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:18.589 line:90%
need everyone to continue to be

00:04:18.589 --> 00:04:20.029 line:90%
cautious that's why we need you

00:04:20.029 --> 00:04:21.350 line:90%
to think about what you did over

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:23.480 line:90%
the holidays if you traveled

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:25.640 line:90%
if you were in a gathering with

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.230 line:90%
a mask off with people outside

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:28.850 line:90%
of your household you can take

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:30.890 line:90%
steps now to prevent you being

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:32.360 line:90%
an asymptomatic spreader

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:34.310 line:90%
and turning into community

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:36.230 line:90%
spread still a chance for us

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:37.700 line:90%
to flatten this curve get

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:40.430 line:90%
to a vaccine wouldn't you say

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:42.080 line:90%
that testing was one

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:44.000 line:90%
of the mistakes at the beginning

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.830 line:90%
and even now you do have testing

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:46.800 line:90%
all over the country.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.810 line:90%
But it's sometimes tough.

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:50.210 line:90%
I talked to many family members

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:51.440 line:90%
who were trying to get the fast

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.450 line:90%
test in order to go feel safe

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:54.950 line:90%
