was 3 to five hours wait it was

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.300 line:90%
maybe you didn't get the fast

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:01.160 line:90%
test it was two three days

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:02.870 line:90%
hasn't that been a vulnerability

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:04.310 line:90%
in how we as a country have

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:07.350 line:90%
dealt with this well I certainly

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:08.520 line:90%
believe testing has been

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.750 line:90%
a challenge but I want people

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.910 line:90%
to know that we are now over 160

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.860 line:90%
million test we've tested more

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:15.580 line:90%
than anyone else in the world I

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.380 line:90%
don't want to say that

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:17.490 line:90%
that's the reason the Pats

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:18.510 line:90%
on the back, but I want people

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:20.110 line:90%
to testing is available.

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:20.910 line:90%
And one of the things

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:21.930 line:90%
we're trying to help people

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:23.670 line:90%
understand particularly public

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.160 line:90%
health officials is that you can

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.870 line:90%
use these new antigen test which

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.800 line:90%
return term results in 15,

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.770 line:90%
20 minutes they are just

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:33.120 line:90%
as effective at practically

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.740 line:90%
understanding who can spread

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:37.050 line:90%
the virus as the PCR test

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:38.550 line:90%
and so we want them

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:40.680 line:90%
to aggressively use these tests

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:41.880 line:90%
so that people can get a quick

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:42.900 line:90%
answer and they know whether

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:43.800 line:90%
or not to isolate

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.110 line:90%
or to quarantine are you talking

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:48.060 line:90%
