that's the plan December 18 is

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:08.190 line:90%
when my journey is scheduled

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:09.450 line:90%
to submit its EUA

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:11.040 line:90%
