00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:13.080 line:90%
and within 24 to 48 hours after

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.460 line:90%
submitting their EUA

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:16.140 line:90%
we from a federal perspective

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.250 line:90%
have promised and it set

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.390 line:90%
everything up so that we can

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:20.170 line:90%
quickly review those the ways.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:21.420 line:90%
