00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:24.050 line:90%
vaccines, again within 24 to 48

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:24.850 line:90%
hours.

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:25.890 line:90%
Our plan is to start

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:27.240 line:90%
by protecting the vulnerable

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:28.330 line:90%
older people,

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:29.550 line:90%
