a vaccine in just a few days

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:56.460 line:90%
to weeks if you sign up

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.110 line:90%
for a study and understand that

00:06:58.110 --> 00:06:59.520 line:90%
again our strategy that

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.360 line:90%
we're telling governors

