then we can slow the spread

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.870 line:90%
of this disease and lower loss

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:08.280 line:90%
of life until everyone can get

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.840 line:90%
a vaccine again into first

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.520 line:90%
quarter into the second quarter

