want people to understand safety

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.310 line:90%
has not been compromised

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:43.270 line:90%
efficacy has not been

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.840 line:90%
compromised what we've done is

